      "text": "A new chapter begins.\n\n@Sec_Noem  unveiled Force Design 2028: a bold, once-in-a-generation plan to transform the 234-year-old Coast Guard into a modern, mission-ready force. 🇺🇸\n\nThank you, Secretary Noem, for your leadership and bold vision to transform the Coast Guard through Force Design 2028.\n\nThrough FD 2028, the Service is revolutionizing how it functions and operates to ensure decisive advantage over adversaries. Focused on four campaigns - People, Organization, Contracting and Acquisition, and Technology - FD 2028 is re-shaping the Coast Guard into a stronger, more ready and capable fighting force. \n\nFD 2028: https://t.co/P3Ta6uZaet\nPress Release: https://t.co/a2GkFcht1K\n\n#uscg #forcedesign2028\n@DHSgov",
