      "quoted_tweet_id": "1931098155439047137",
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Exceptional work by the crews of CGC Valiant and CGC Vigorous!\n\nThrough their vigilant presence across our southern border and maritime approaches, over 20,000 pounds of harmful drugs will never reach our streets.\n\nThrough their diligence in bringing the fight to Transnational Criminal Organizations, cartels will be deprived of over $138 million to continue their illicit activities.\n\nThrough their tireless efforts on patrol, CGC Valiant and CGC Vigorous have been leading the Coast Guard's efforts to secure our borders.\n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation.\n@USCGLANTAREA @USCGSoutheast @DHSgov \n#USCG #DrugInterdiction",
      "text_resolved": "Exceptional work by the crews of CGC Valiant and CGC Vigorous!\n\nThrough their vigilant presence across our southern border and maritime approaches, over 20,000 pounds of harmful drugs will never reach our streets.\n\nThrough their diligence in bringing the fight to Transnational Criminal Organizations, cartels will be deprived of over $138 million to continue their illicit activities.\n\nThrough their tireless efforts on patrol, CGC Valiant and CGC Vigorous have been leading the Coast Guard's efforts to secure our borders.\n\nA vigilant Coast Guard means a safer nation.\n@USCGLANTAREA @USCGSoutheast @DHSgov \n#USCG #DrugInterdiction",
