      "quoted_tweet_id": "1931750045486813672",
      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Throughout the Gulf of America, and across our southern border and approaches, the U.S. Coast Guard remains on watch, enforcing our laws and protecting our sovereignty. Whether it's drug smuggling, human trafficking, or illegal fishing, we will detect, deter, and interdict the threat wherever it moves.\n\nThis includes countering illegal, cartel-linked fishing operations that threaten the sustainability of vital fisheries critical to the U.S. economy.\n\n@USCGHeartland  @USCGLANTAREA \n#oceansweek #USCG",
      "text_resolved": "Throughout the Gulf of America, and across our southern border and approaches, the U.S. Coast Guard remains on watch, enforcing our laws and protecting our sovereignty. Whether it's drug smuggling, human trafficking, or illegal fishing, we will detect, deter, and interdict the threat wherever it moves.\n\nThis includes countering illegal, cartel-linked fishing operations that threaten the sustainability of vital fisheries critical to the U.S. economy.\n\n@USCGHeartland  @USCGLANTAREA \n#oceansweek #USCG",
